## For Solo Founder | Target: Freelance Accountants & Tiny Agencies

---

## 1. BEST-FIT PRIMARY MODEL: Tiered Subscription

### Why Subscription?
- Predictable MRR (Monthly Recurring Revenue)
- Low billing complexity with modern processors
- Matches "ongoing value" nature of automation tools
- Aligns with constraint: monthly billing preference

### Pricing Tiers (Monthly)

| Tier | Price | Best For | Key Features |
|------|-------|----------|--------------|
| Starter | $29/mo | Solo freelancers | 50 invoices/mo, email reminders, basic reporting |
| Pro | $79/mo | Small agencies (2-5 seats) | 200 invoices/mo, SMS reminders, custom templates, team access |
| Agency | $199/mo | Growing agencies | Unlimited invoices, API access, white-label, priority support |

### Rationale
- $29 entry point: Low barrier for solo accountants testing the tool
- $79 sweet spot: Main revenue driver for small agencies
- $199 anchor: Makes Pro look reasonable, captures high-value users

---

## 2. SECONDARY REVENUE STREAMS

### A. One-Time Template Pack ($49)
- Pre-built invoice reminder templates for different industries
- Email/SMS scripts, follow-up cadences, compliance-safe language
- Why it works: Immediate cash, low marginal cost, helps free users convert

### B. Optional Setup Consulting ($199 one-time)
- 60-minute onboarding call
- Custom workflow setup
- Integration with their existing tools (QuickBooks, Xero, etc.)
- Why it works: High perceived value, filters serious buyers, builds relationships

### Recommendation: Start with Template Pack only
- Consulting adds time complexity for a solo founder
- Add consulting later when you have 50+ paying customers
- Template pack can be automated delivery via Gumroad/Stripe

---

## 3. PAYMENT FLOW (Solo-Founder Optimized)

### Recommended Stack
- Payments: Stripe (2.9% + $0.30/transaction)
- Invoicing: Stripe Invoicing (built-in)
- Customer Portal: Stripe Customer Portal (self-serve upgrades/cancel)
- Template Pack: Gumroad or Stripe Payment Links

### Why This Stack?
- Stripe handles: recurring billing, dunning, tax estimates, PCI compliance
- Customer Portal: lets users self-serve (no support tickets for billing)
- No custom invoicing code: use Stripes built-in invoicing
- Single dashboard: all payments in one place

### Key Settings to Configure
1. Enable automatic retry for failed cards (3 attempts over 7 days)
2. Set dunning emails (Stripe defaults are good)
3. Configure webhooks for: invoice.payment_succeeded, customer.subscription.deleted
4. Enable customer portal link in app settings

---

## 4. SIMPLE 12-MONTH PROJECTION

### Assumptions
- Launch month: Month 1
- Conversion rate: 2% of landing page visitors
- Churn: 5% monthly (typical for small B2B SaaS)
- Average Revenue Per User (ARPU): $55 (mix of tiers)

### Monthly Projection

| Month | New Cust | Active Cust | MRR | Template Sales | Consulting | Total Rev |
